      'wholesale-pro-electric-water-gun-with-led-recoil',
      'high-volume-cartoon-bubble-blower-gun-12000-per-min',
    ]}
    note="Three water blasters for splash zones and rental counters, plus a low-cost bubble gun for the prize tier."
  />
</SectionLayout>
